        "original_id": "0731d039-0a4b-5e30-98e9-4850b935ae4e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matt Groening, Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, Rich Moore, Hank Azaria\n- Characters: Apu Nahasapeemapetilon, Manjula\n- Episodes: The Telltale Head, Eight Misbehavin'\n- Topics: voice acting, television writing, television directing, octuplets, fertility drugs, corporate sponsorship\n\nFacts:\n- Matt Groening was born on February 15, 1954, and he is an American cartoonist, writer, producer, animator, and voice actor.\n- The episode \"The Telltale Head\" was written by Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, and Matt Groening, and it was directed by Rich Moore.\n- Apu Nahasapeemapetilon first appeared in the episode \"The Telltale Head\" and is voiced by Hank Azaria.\n- In the episode \"Eight Misbehavin',\" Manjula gives birth to octuplets as a result of fertility drugs.\n- In the episode \"Eight Misbehavin',\" Manjula and Apu allow a zookeeper to exploit their babies in exchange for help after corporate sponsors abandon them for a mother who gave birth to nonuplets.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
